{"seq":1,"slug":"instancing-batching","title":"实例化与批处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/rendering/instancing-batching","wordCount":1507,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"实例化与批处理\">实例化与批处理</h1><p>画一万株草的朴素写法是循环一万次、每次发一个绘制调用，结果 CPU 在提交命令上就累垮了，GPU 还没怎么干活。实例化（instancing）的核心思想只有一句：同一份网格只描述一次，让 GPU 重复画很多遍，每遍只换一点点 per-instance 数据。这一篇讲清楚实例化为什么快、per-instance 数据怎么布局、合批与实例化的区别，以及它如何成为整个植被吞吐链的地基。它偿还的是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-vegetation-hard\">为何植被难</a> 列出的吞吐债。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一次提交-万次绘制\">核心概念：一次提交，万次绘制</h2><p>绘制调用（draw call）贵在 CPU 侧：每次都要校验状态、绑定资源、翻译成 GPU 命令。设单次 draw call 的 CPU 开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{call}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单株顶点处理为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>vert</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{vert}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、株数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，朴素提交与实例化提交的 CPU 成本对比是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>naive</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>vert</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>inst</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>vert</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{naive}} = N \\cdot (c_{\\text{call}} + c_{\\text{vert}}), \\qquad C_{\\text{inst}} = c_{\\text{call}} + N \\cdot c_{\\text{vert}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">naive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inst</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 上万、而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{call}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>vert</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{vert}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，实例化把 CPU 提交开销从「乘以 N」降成「加一次」。下图是这条数据通路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一份网格 VB/IB] --&gt; D[GPU 实例化绘制]&#10;  B[per-instance 缓冲&lt;br/&gt;变换/色变/风相位] --&gt; D&#10;  C[DrawIndexedInstanced&lt;br/&gt;instanceCount=N] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[顶点着色器&lt;br/&gt;按 InstanceID 取实例数据]&#10;  E --&gt; F[N 株各就各位]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一份网格 VB/IB] --&gt; D[GPU 实例化绘制]\n  B[per-instance 缓冲&lt;br/&gt;变换/色变/风相位] --&gt; D\n  C[DrawIndexedInstanced&lt;br/&gt;instanceCount=N] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[顶点着色器&lt;br/&gt;按 InstanceID 取实例数据]\n  E --&gt; F[N 株各就各位]</pre><p>下表对比三种把多株草送上 GPU 的方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>draw call 数</th>\n<th>每株可不同的</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素逐株提交</td>\n<td>N</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>调试/极少量</td>\n<td>CPU 提交爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态合批 (merge)</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>几乎不能（烘死）</td>\n<td>不动的小物件</td>\n<td>顶点内存翻倍、不能单独剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件实例化</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>per-instance 数据</td>\n<td>海量同种植被</td>\n<td>同一网格 + 材质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"per-instance-数据-每株的身份证\">per-instance 数据：每株的身份证</h2><p>实例化要快，关键是别为每株存一份网格，只存它和「模板」的差异。这份差异放进一个 per-instance 缓冲，顶点着色器用内建的实例索引（<code>SV_InstanceID</code> / <code>gl_InstanceID</code>）去取自己那一条。一株草的身份证通常包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>世界变换（位置、旋转、缩放），常压成一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵或「位置 + 四元数 + 缩放」12–16 字节；</li>\n<li>色变参数（色相/明度偏移），喂给 <a href=\"../foundations/vegetation-components\">植被视觉成分</a> 要求的每实例色彩离散；</li>\n<li>风相位偏移，让每株风动不同步，供 <a href=\"../animation/wind-animation\">风动动画</a> 使用；</li>\n<li>LOD/淡入淡出因子，供 <a href=\"../practice/vegetation-lod\">植被 LOD</a> 做抖动过渡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>布局上要让缓冲对 GPU 缓存友好：同一份数据结构紧凑排布（SoA 或对齐的 AoS），避免顶点着色器为取一个 float 拉一整条 cache line。这正是数据导向设计的思路，背景见 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">缓存与数据导向</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合批-vs-实例化-别混为一谈\">合批 vs 实例化：别混为一谈</h2><p>「批处理」是个被滥用的词，得分清两种。静态合批（static batching / mesh merge）是把许多物件的顶点焊进一个大网格，一次画完——它省 draw call，但每个物件的顶点被实际复制了，内存翻倍，而且整块要么全画要么全不画，无法对单株做剔除或 LOD。它适合一堆永不移动、永远一起出现的小道具。</p>\n<p>硬件实例化（instancing）只存一份网格 + N 条轻量实例数据，内存省、还能在 GPU 上对每株独立做剔除和 LOD 决策。对植被——海量、同种、需要逐株剔除和淡出——实例化几乎总是对的选择。两者也能叠加：把几种草的网格放进一个图集材质，再对每种实例化，用「合并材质 + 多重实例化」减少状态切换。这种状态合批的通用原则见 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/draw-calls-batching\">绘制调用与合批</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"间接绘制-把实例数交给-gpu-决定\">间接绘制：把实例数交给 GPU 决定</h2><p>普通实例化里，株数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是 CPU 在录制命令时写死的。但植被的实际可见株数要等剔除完才知道，而剔除最好在 GPU 上做（见 <a href=\"gpu-driven-foliage\">GPU 驱动植被</a>）。间接绘制（indirect draw）解决这个时序矛盾：CPU 发一条 <code>DrawIndexedInstancedIndirect</code>，它的 instanceCount 不是立即数，而是从一个 GPU 缓冲里读——这个缓冲由前一个计算着色器（剔除 pass）填好。</p>\n<p>于是流程变成：计算着色器遍历所有候选株、做视锥/距离剔除、把通过的实例追加进一个紧凑缓冲并原子递增计数器；绘制时 GPU 直接按这个计数器画。CPU 全程不知道也不关心最终画了几株。这把 <a href=\"../foundations/why-vegetation-hard\">为何植被难</a> 的吞吐债从「CPU 提交」彻底搬到「GPU 自治」，是现代植被管线的枢纽，下一篇专门展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实例化的边界与陷阱\">实例化的边界与陷阱</h2><p>实例化不是万能钥匙，几个常见坑要记住。其一，所有实例必须共享同一网格 + 同一材质/PSO，材质一变就得换一批，所以植被资产要尽量收敛到少数共享材质。其二，per-instance 缓冲过大或布局松散会让顶点着色器变成访存瓶颈，反而抵消省下的提交开销。其三，过度合批会让剔除粒度变粗——一整块一起剔，远不如逐株精细，画面里会出现「整片突然消失」。其四，实例太少时实例化的固定开销不划算，几株的小物件不如朴素提交。把握住「同种 + 海量 + 需逐株剔除」这三个前提，实例化才真正发挥威力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实例化把 CPU 提交开销从「乘以 N」降成「加一次」：一份网格 + N 条 per-instance 数据，GPU 重复画。</li>\n<li>per-instance 数据是每株的身份证：变换、色变、风相位、LOD 因子，布局要缓存友好。</li>\n<li>静态合批复制顶点、不能逐株剔除；硬件实例化省内存、可逐株决策——植被选后者。</li>\n<li>间接绘制让 GPU（剔除 pass）决定实例数，CPU 不再写死 N，是 GPU 驱动管线的枢纽。</li>\n<li>三前提：同网格同材质、海量、需逐株剔除——满足才用实例化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：让 GPU 自己剔除并生成实例数见 <a href=\"gpu-driven-foliage\">GPU 驱动植被</a>；远处用 impostor 作为一种特殊实例几何见 <a href=\"billboard-impostor\">广告牌与 impostor</a>；per-instance 风相位的用法见 <a href=\"../animation/wind-animation\">风动动画</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：绘制调用与合批的通用方法论见 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/draw-calls-batching\">绘制调用与合批</a>；实例数据布局的缓存原理见 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">缓存与数据导向</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实例化与批处理","id":"实例化与批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一次提交，万次绘制","id":"核心概念-一次提交-万次绘制"},{"level":2,"text":"per-instance 数据：每株的身份证","id":"per-instance-数据-每株的身份证"},{"level":2,"text":"合批 vs 实例化：别混为一谈","id":"合批-vs-实例化-别混为一谈"},{"level":2,"text":"间接绘制：把实例数交给 GPU 决定","id":"间接绘制-把实例数交给-gpu-决定"},{"level":2,"text":"实例化的边界与陷阱","id":"实例化的边界与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"技术谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/foundations/vegetation-techniques"},"next":{"title":"GPU 驱动植被","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/rendering/gpu-driven-foliage"}}